(footprint "ESP32_Dev_Board_Breakout"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Real ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 DevKitC-1 dual-USB-C variant, 44 pins (22/row), 2.54mm pitch, 25.40mm row spacing (1.27mm inset from each edge on a 27.94mm-wide board). Pin labels and this shield's schematic-pin-number mapping are per the board's own silkscreen GPIO numbers -- confirmed against a full pinout diagram. Board length is the pin-to-pin span (53.34mm, 21 gaps x 2.54mm, per direct user measurement) plus 0.85mm margin on each end (half the 1.7mm pad size) so the through-hole pads are physically whole rather than clipped by the board edge -- this is a normal pin-header board, not castellated.")
